{"text": "Tne Councn. For Tonacco Resvarcu-U.S.A,, Inc.\na0\n\noT STH STREET\nNEW YORK, N.Y. 10022\n\nJanuary 12, 1983\n\nMr. Edvard A. Horrigan, Jr.\nChairman and Chief Executive Officer\n\nR. J. Reynolds \u2018Tobacco Company\nWinston-Salem, N.C. 27102\n\nDear Mr. Horrigan:\n\nEnclosed are tentative agendas, together with\nthe drafts of certain resolutions, for the meetings of\n\nthe Matbers and of the Board of Directors of The Council\nto be held on Friday, January 28, 1983, starting at\n10:00 A.M. I look forward to seeing you at that time.\n\nCordially,\nF, Gertenbach\nRFG/Ip\n\nEncls.\n\nnite n6e0oS",
